*Relevant Formulae for Cyclic Processes:*

- Monatomic Ideal Gas:
  $ C_V = (3) / (2) R, quad C_P = (5) / (2) R $
  $ U = (3) / (2) n R T, quad H = (5) / (2) n R T $

- First Law of Thermodynamics:
  $ Delta U = Q + W $

- Work ($W$) by process:
  - Isobaric ($P = "const"$): $W = -P (V_2 - V_1)$
  - Isothermal ($T = "const"$): $W = -n R T ln((V_2) / (V_1)) = n R T ln((P_2) / (P_1))$
  - Isochoric ($V = "const"$): $W = 0$
